{"id":"615840","name":"香葱油饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615840/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面团","amount":"约70g"},{"name":"香葱叶","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"小许"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取小许面粉。","img":"images/615840/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"烧热油倒在面粉里。","img":"images/615840/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/615840/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"自己重的香葱。","img":"images/615840/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"一次一些叶子洗净。","img":"images/615840/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/615840/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"葱末放油酥里拌匀。","img":"images/615840/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"剩面团。","img":"images/615840/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揉光擀长饼。","img":"images/615840/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放上葱油酥。","img":"images/615840/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/615840/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再如图卷起来。","img":"images/615840/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀薄约半公分。","img":"images/615840/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放热锅里。","img":"images/615840/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"烙至鼓起来。","img":"images/615840/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/615840/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"再翻面，翻两次即可。","img":"images/615840/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"取出来切块。","img":"images/615840/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/615840/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"外酥里嫩，好香的。","img":"images/615840/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}